    "text": "<p><math><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0049_4da2122f1fbc.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.13514in;height:0.47493in\" /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Taking intersection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</